<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,456 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,456 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,456 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,453 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 4		   Nov 1</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,456		   5,453</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	5.19		    1.88</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
